Hi,

Rpy2-2.3.5 is out. This is a bugfix release in the 2.3.x series, with a 
number of the niceties in the development branch implemented 
during/following the (awesome) PyCon conference after meeting with the 
iPython and pandas folks backported whenever possible.

The integration between ipython, the ipython notebook, and pandas, is 
improving and contributions from Dav Clark that already made it to this 
release announce more good things to come.

As usual, user-visible changes are listed here: 
http://rpy.sourceforge.net/rpy2/doc-2.3/html/changes.html#relase-2-3-5

Best,


Laurent

